      "description": "This panel contains no data. Its only purpose is the InfluxDB alert.\n\nThis alert is only supposed to catch \"execution errors\" like `tsdb.HandleRequest() error Get \"http://localhost:8086/query?…: dial tcp [::1]:8086: connect: connection refused`. Hence there's just a query which is never supposed to return any data which is treated as \"ok\" and only execution errors trigger the alert.",
